get.description:
Get labels by the specified label Names, object_type, object_id.
Accepts the parameters of the object to get the label from in the query:
 - object_type - this is the type of object to which the label needs to be attached;
 - object_id - id of the entity to subscribe to.

important: object_id='/', because the path parameter {projectKey} is passed

example: To get the labels association with the project 'project-1', call this method with the parameters:
 - object_type='projects';
 - object_id='/';
 - projectKey='project-1'.

Datasource: DB

